  "details": "I think we should have a References section in Slack where when ppl find a link or something that they knows works they can post it for others.  It would help out a lot I believe w/ esp. beginners and such in finding the answers to their questions.  For me at least, I always seem to want to do things in my worlds that I have a hard time finding the way to get it done and end up spending hrs searching the web and videos to find one that works w/ the version of unity we are using.  I feel it would be a very useful resource for avatar and world/room development to be completed more fluidly.  Thanks :-)",
